ype articles that focus on training enrollment prices, certificate promotion, and salary rankings - these should be excluded per the user's explicit preference.\n\nLet me identify the relevant content types:\n- \"操作记录\" (operation records) - minimal reproduction scenarios, logs, fault handling\n- \"条件与原理\" (conditions and principles) - state changes, concurrency, resource boundaries\n- \"概念速览\" (concept overview) - concepts for further reading\n- \"专题观察\" (special topic observation) - community activities, software history, developer interviews, team culture\n\nThe \"市场观察\" (market observation) articles explicitly contain training enrollment prices, certificate promotion, salary rankings - these violate the user's explicit preference and should be excluded.\n\nThe user wants 20 candidates. Let me select from the non-market-observation articles that are relevant to Java backend engineering (databases, concurrency, service fault handling).\n\nLet me categorize the candidates by topic:\n- 事务传播 (transaction propagation) - database\n- 缓存失效 (cache invalidation) - database/cache\n- 任务取消 (task cancellation) - concurrency\n- 线程池排队 (thread pool queueing) - concurrency\n- 连接池等待 (connection pool waiting) - database\n- 接口幂等 (interface idempotency) - service\n- 并发更新 (concurrent update) - concurrency\n- 慢查询 (slow query) - database\n- 组合索引 (composite index) - database\n- 消息重复 (message duplication) - service/messaging\n\nAll these topics are relevant to Java backend engineering.\n\nLet me identify which candidates are \"市场观察\" (to exclude):\n- item-0ac50d9f7f27 (线程池排队：社区服务中的市场观察)\n- item-0af1c4827cd8 (连接池等待：后台处理任务中的市场观察)\n- item-0be6197962c6 (接口幂等：内容管理接口中的市场观察)\n- item-10482516c15c (缓存失效：消息消费者中的市场观察)\n- item-1178ddd58b15 (并发更新：社区服务中的市场观察)\n- item-1a7442187146 (线程池排队：后台处理任务中的市场观察)\n- item-1c3f785dd079 (任务取消：内容管理接口中的市场观察)\n- item-3356f301eff1 (事务传播：消息消费者中的市场观察)\n- item-34481c910531 (连接池等待：内容管理接口中的市场观察)\n- item-3b9f2dc9469c (事务传播：内容管理接口中的市场观察)\n- item-3cca11fe4770 (并发更新：内容管理接口中的市场观察)\n- item-3dd8795cff7b (组合索引：消息消费者中的市场观察)\n- item-4780c84a7983 (消息重复：消息消费者中的市场观察)\n- item-50c1d851bc3e (连接池等待：社区服务中的市场观察)\n- item-5844dd71f1b0 (任务取消：消息消费者中的市场观察)\n- item-5fcb0644cc52 (接口幂等：社区服务中的市场观察)\n- item-636d70dcfcba (接口幂等：后台处理任务中的市场观察)\n\nThese market observation articles should be excluded.\n\nNow I need to select 20 from the remaining candidates. Let me count the non-market candidates. There are 80 total candidates. Let me select 20 relevant ones.\n\nThe user's interest emphasizes databases, concurrency, and service fault handling. The most relevant content types are \"操作记录\" (fault handling/operation records), \"条件与原理\" (principles), and \"概念速览\" (concepts). The \"专题观察\" articles focus on community activities, software history, developer interviews, and team culture - these are less directly relevant to the technical implementation focus.\n\nLet me prioritize the technical content articles. Let me select a balanced set across topics and content types.\n\nLet me pick 20 candidates focusing on the technical content (操作记录, 条件与原理, 概念速览) across the various topics, avoiding market observation and preferring technical depth.\n\nLet me list the non-market candidates with their topics:\n\nTransaction propagation (事务传播):\n- item-017f29068cff (专题观察)\n- item-167782abe824 (条件与原理)\n- item-2c20f0a4b41e (专题观察)\n- item-356556f36ad8 (概念速览)\n- item-3b6e33dce189 (条件与原理)\n- item-45f8ac57ea42 (操作记录)\n- item-493d69ea1678 (条件与原理)\n\nCache invalidation (缓存失效):\n- item-042e55d675a0 (操作记录)\n- item-05526cd9d6f6 (专题观察)\n- item-17427e9b8667 (概念速览)\n- item-3c858ef0f07f (概念速览)\n- item-43d0c40117a8 (概念速览)\n- item-5987d238b7de (操作记录)\n\nTask cancellation (任务取消):\n- item-07ad7c7c66a5 (条件与原理)\n- item-38229375fac7 (操作记录)\n- item-4321501c7f4d (概念速览)\n- item-501f16c5db37 (条件与原理)\n- item-52cdcfdacb13 (操作记录)\n- item-5b1d60a35a47 (操作记录)\n- item-5d2fe500c260 (专题观察)\n- item-664fac62b6b2 (专题观察)\n\nThread pool queueing (线程池排队):\n- item-07b1bd992c27 (概念速览)\n- item-0b384ee33ac6 (概念速览)\n- item-5b30b4b228eb (专题观察)\n- item-5ccc33f5cce3 (条件与原理)\n- item-5feeb605a5de (专题观察)\n\nConnection pool waiting (连接池等待):\n- item-098771075993 (操作记录)\n- item-16f7b9cc23ce (专题观察)\n- item-1ba5c7242ee5 (操作记录)\n- item-20bfb5d44845 (条件与原理)\n- item-484f44814a6c (条件与原理)\n- item-506e45b23eac (概念速览)\n- item-63e2cdd7c63f (概念速览)\n\nInterface idempotency (接口幂等):\n- item-0cf0da59e8f8 (操作记录)\n- item-31156631e3f2 (条件与原理)\n- item-326a31675f38 (操作记录)\n- item-3494031e73f0 (条件与原理)\n- item-379d2668d6db (操作记录)\n- item-411d8cec1d53 (概念速览)\n- item-42b108253919 (专题观察)\n- item-45615792d6e5 (专题观察)\n- item-48bbae8e6847 (条件与原理)\n- item-623f03c7a67f (概念速览)\n\nConcurrent update (并发更新):\n- item-1682f42295f8 (概念速览)\n- item-17c3bb0307b5 (条件与原理)\n- item-446a8890fe41 (专题观察)\n- item-4ade042008f1 (概念速览)\n- item-5160144d6193 (操作记录)\n- item-597155538375 (条件与原理)\n- item-6297496ed6b3 (专题观察)\n\nSlow query (慢查询):\n- item-140efafef8fc (概念速览)\n- item-258baaba2425 (专题观察)\n- item-32e7f1169374 (概念速览)\n- item-37ef339921da (操作记录)\n- item-5462ffc0ac28 (操作记录)\n- item-571b5b9bcd0a (专题观察)\n- item-58703f69d7f8 (专题观察)\n\nComposite index (组合索引):\n- item-1d10939960ab (专题观察)\n- item-37b1c2d06752 (概念速览)\n- item-3b4891c0e401 (操作记录)\n- item-499e6590050c (条件与原理)\n\nMessage duplication (消息重复):\n- item-1d6434c1a27f (操作记录)\n- item-3a036e513cc4 (条件与原理)\n\nI need to select 20. The user's interest is databases, concurrency, and service fault handling. I should prioritize technical content (操作记录, 条件与原理, 概念速览) over 专题观察 (which is more about community/culture).\n\nLet me select a balanced set across the topics. I'll aim for a good mix of the technical content types. Let me select 20 candidates.\n\nGiven the user's focus on databases, concurrency, and service fault handling, I'll select a balanced set. Let me choose candidates that represent the technical content well.\n\nLet me select these 20:\n\n1. item-167782abe824 - 事务传播 条件与原理 (database)\n2. item-45f8ac57ea42 - 事务传播 操作记录 (database)\n3. item-042e55d675a0 - 缓存失效 操作记录 (database/cache)\n4. item-3c858ef0f07f - 缓存失效 概念速览 (database/cache)\n5. item-07ad7c7c66a5 - 任务取消 条件与原理 (concurrency)\n6. item-5b1d60a35a47 - 任务取消 操作记录 (concurrency)\n7. item-0b384ee33ac6 - 线程池排队 概念速览 (concurrency)\n8. item-5ccc33f5cce3 - 线程池排队 条件与原理 (concurrency)\n9. item-098771075993 - 连接池等待 操作记录 (database)\n10. item-484f44814a6c - 连接池等待 条件与原理 (database)\n11. item-0cf0da59e8f8 - 接口幂等 操作记录 (service)\n12. item-48bbae8e6847 - 接口幂等 条件与原理 (service)\n13. item-597155538375 - 并发更新 条件与原理 (concurrency)\n14. item-5160144d6193 - 并发更新 操作记录 (concurrency)\n15. item-5462ffc0ac28 - 慢查询 操作记录 (database)\n16. item-32e7f1169374 - 慢查询 概念速览 (database)\n17. item-3b4891c0e401 - 组合索引 操作记录 (database)\n18. item-499e6590050c - 组合索引 条件与原理 (database)\n19. item-1d6434c1a27f - 消息重复 操作记录 (service)\n20. item-3a036e513cc4 - 消息重复 条件与原理 (service)\n\nThis gives a balanced set across all 10 topics, with technical content types (操作记录, 条件与原理, 概念速览), avoiding market observation and 专题观察 (community/culture content less relevant to technical implementation focus).\n\nLet me verify these are all non-market candidates. Yes, all selected are technical content.\n\nLet me publish these recommendations.","type":"text"},{"arguments":{"items":[{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-167782abe824","recommendationReason":"事务传播的条件与原理直接对应你对数据库事务实现原理的关注，文中分析状态变化、并发顺序与资源边界的关系，符合 Java 后端工程对事务机制原理的深入需求。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-45f8ac57ea42","recommendationReason":"事务传播的操作记录提供最小复现场景与关键日志，展示修改前后的执行过程并列出验证步骤，契合你对服务故障处理与数据库事务实际排查的需求。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-042e55d675a0","recommendationReason":"缓存失效的操作记录以社区服务为背景给出复现场景与日志定位过程，属于数据库/缓存一致性故障处理范畴，贴合你对服务故障处理实现与排查的兴趣。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-3c858ef0f07f","recommendationReason":"缓存失效的概念速览梳理常用概念并列出问题目录，可作为你深入数据库缓存一致性原理的阅读入口。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-07ad7c7c66a5","recommendationReason":"任务取消的条件与原理解释并发顺序与资源边界关系并用反例说明机制边界，直接服务你对并发实现原理的关注。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-5b1d60a35a47","recommendationReason":"任务取消的操作记录给出最小复现与关键日志，展示并发任务取